    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d292">

                <pb facs="0500" n="398" sameAs="frus:frus1933v01/pg398"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">740.0011 Four Power Pact/17</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Memorandum by the Secretary of State</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">[<placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>,] <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1933-03-28">March 28, 1933</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>The French Ambassador<anchor n="15" xml:id="d292-f1"/> came in and handed me a
                    memorandum of three pages containing comment and views of the French Government
                    relative to the recent MacDonald and Mussolini peace and disarmament proposals.
                    I stated that I was especially glad to have the benefit of the French viewpoint
                    to this partial extent at least.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>C[<hi rendition="#small-caps">ordell</hi>] H[<hi rendition="#small-caps"
                            >ull</hi>]</signed>
                </closer>


                <xi:include href="d292-a1.xml" xpointer="d292-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d292-f1" n="15" xml:id="d292-f1-content">
                <p>Paul Claudel.</p>
            </note>
